38
00:03:26,320 --> 00:03:27,510
Blazing Sky Nine Feathers !

39
00:03:27,870 --> 00:03:28,670
Go !

40
00:03:40,040 --> 00:03:42,110
That's the killer move of Teng Seven !?

41
00:03:42,240 --> 00:03:43,820
So the rest of the Core Family Members

42
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:46,030
