43
00:03:46,430 --> 00:03:47,460
Very good.

44
00:03:51,030 --> 00:03:51,830
Die...

45
00:04:11,320 --> 00:04:12,110
This...

46
00:04:12,440 --> 00:04:14,300
What kind of spell is this !?

47
00:04:19,310 --> 00:04:20,190
Stay hidden,

48
00:04:20,310 --> 00:04:21,380
