49
00:05:01,830 --> 00:05:03,100
The Core Members are dead.

50
00:05:03,150 --> 00:05:04,680
Everyone, return to the inner city !

51
00:05:04,680 --> 00:05:06,030
The Ancestor will be able to kill him !

52
00:05:06,320 --> 00:05:06,880
Hurry up !

53
00:05:06,880 --> 00:05:08,110
He can't keep this up for long.

54
00:05:15,910 --> 00:05:17,820
This city has been here for hundreds of years.

55
00:05:14,400 --> 00:05:15,230
Running away ?

56
00:05:14,400 --> 00:05:17,720
Teng Bo\NTeng Family 9th generation\NLate stage Core Formation

57
00:05:18,040 --> 00:05:19,320
How can you tolerate an intruder !?

58
00:05:20,520 --> 00:05:22,190
Besides, the Ancestor is still in the city,

59
00:05:22,520 --> 00:05:23,840
there is nothing to fear.

60
00:05:23,930 --> 00:05:26,010
We will act together to kill the enemy.

61
00:05:26,590 --> 00:05:28,110
All Teng Family Members,

62
00:05:28,800 --> 00:05:30,900
follow me in this bloody battle !

63
00:05:32,880 --> 00:05:33,580
That's right !

64
00:05:33,590 --> 00:05:34,700
The intruder

65
00:05:35,230 --> 00:05:38,940
must be killed !

66
00:05:43,320 --> 00:05:44,500
Teng Huayuan,

67
00:05:44,800 --> 00:05:47,060
are you a coward ?

68
00:06:09,560 --> 00:06:10,390
Hold on,

69
00:06:10,800 --> 00:06:11,660
don't retreat !

70
00:06:12,230 --> 00:06:13,780
The Ancestor will definitely come !

71
00:06:23,440 --> 00:06:24,310
Kill him !

72
00:06:26,950 --> 00:06:28,140
Attack together !

73
00:06:28,280 --> 00:06:29,540
Kill him !

74
00:06:36,400 --> 00:06:37,500
Teng Huayuan,

75
00:06:38,910 --> 00:06:40,110
do you remember

76
00:06:40,520 --> 00:06:43,620
how you slaughtered my Wang Family ?

77
00:06:44,260 --> 00:06:45,230
Today

78
00:06:46,430 --> 00:06:47,510
I will

79
00:06:48,320 --> 00:06:51,310
pay you back a thousand times.

80
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:53,180
Go !

81
00:06:53,190 --> 00:06:53,740
That's...

82
00:06:54,270 --> 00:06:56,110
