86
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:26,460
Wang Lin...

87
00:07:30,080 --> 00:07:31,720
Suppress evil, eliminate the Demons,

88
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:33,100
connect to the Gods.

89
00:07:33,720 --> 00:07:35,060
Divine Sword !

90
00:07:35,880 --> 00:07:36,500
Fall !

91
00:07:53,590 --> 00:07:54,990
A Soul Formation artifact ?

92
00:07:55,920 --> 00:07:57,300
I see,

93
00:07:58,120 --> 00:07:59,820
