98
00:08:29,480 --> 00:08:31,420
I killed you once before.

99
00:08:31,730 --> 00:08:33,780
I can kill you again !

100
00:08:39,120 --> 00:08:40,500
A heaven defying

101
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:42,500
Soul Formation artifact...

102
00:08:43,110 --> 00:08:44,580
Truly amazing.

103
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:48,190
But in order to control it,

104
00:08:48,920 --> 00:08:52,360
