110
00:10:12,120 --> 00:10:13,190
Wang Lin...

111
00:10:16,040 --> 00:10:17,270
How does it feel ?

112
00:10:19,210 --> 00:10:20,100
Does it hurt ?

113
00:10:24,520 --> 00:10:26,900
When you killed my whole family,

114
00:10:28,120 --> 00:10:29,950
