115
00:10:33,720 --> 00:10:35,910
You killed my grandchild Teng Li

116
00:10:36,680 --> 00:10:38,310
so I destroyed your whole family.

117
00:10:39,520 --> 00:10:40,750
Your Wang Family

118
00:10:42,040 --> 00:10:43,330
